<view class="hero"><view class="eyebrow">四川麻将 / 积分账本</view><view class="headline"><view>牌局尽兴，</view><view>分数记清。</view></view><view class="hero-sub">一张截图一局 · 真人加权 · 总分逐局累加</view></view>
<view class="body">
 <view class="card summary"><view class="row"><view><view class="title">本场积分</view><view class="muted">已记 {{roundCount}} 局 · 合计 0.00</view></view><button size="mini" bindtap="settings" disabled="{{busy}}">牌友设置</button></view>
 <view class="score-grid"><view wx:for="{{players}}" wx:key="index" class="score"><view class="small">{{item.name}} <text wx:if="{{item.robot}}" class="robot">机器人</text></view><view class="total {{item.negative?'negative':'positive'}}">{{item.total}}</view></view></view>
 <view class="muted rule">机器人无论输赢均记0分。每局加权后保留两位小数，再计入累计。</view></view>
 <view wx:if="{{storageError}}" class="card warning">本机数据异常，已暂停入账。请先备份原数据，再恢复或新开一场。</view>
 <view class="tabs"><view class="{{tab==='entry'?'active':''}}" data-tab="entry" bindtap="setTab">记一局</view><view class="{{tab==='history'?'active':''}}" data-tab="history" bindtap="setTab">牌局记录</view><view class="{{tab==='tools'?'active':''}}" data-tab="tools" bindtap="setTab">备份与说明</view></view>
 <view wx:if="{{tab==='entry'}}" class="card"><view class="row"><view class="title">记录第 {{roundNumber}} 局</view><text class="pill">核对后入账</text></view><view class="actions"><button class="primary" bindtap="chooseImage" disabled="{{busy}}">＋ 选择结算截图</button><button wx:if="{{image}}" bindtap="recognize" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">云端识别</button></view>
 <image wx:if="{{image}}" src="{{image}}" mode="widthFix" class="shot"/>
 <view wx:if="{{ocrMessage}}" class="muted message">{{ocrMessage}}</view>
 <view wx:if="{{review.length}}" class="review"><view class="title">核对截图中的四行</view><view class="muted">选择对应玩家；未出现的第五位记0。无法识别的数字请手动补全。</view>
 <view wx:for="{{review}}" wx:key="index" class="review-row"><view class="small">第{{index+1}}行 · {{item.name||'昵称未识别'}}</view><view class="row"><picker range="{{players}}" range-key="name" value="{{item.player<0?0:item.player}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindchange="reviewPlayer"><view class="picker">{{item.player<0?'选择玩家':players[item.player].name}} ▾</view></picker><input value="{{item.score}}" type="text" maxlength="9" placeholder="原始分，保留正负号" data-index="{{index}}" bindinput="reviewScore"/></view></view>
 <button class="primary" bindtap="applyReview">确认对应关系 · 填入下方</button><button class="raw-button" bindtap="toggleRaw">{{showRaw?'收起':'查看'}}原始识别文字</button><text wx:if="{{showRaw}}" selectable class="raw">{{raw}}</text></view>
 <view class="label">原始积分 <text class="muted">（可直接手动录入）</text></view>
 <view wx:for="{{players}}" wx:key="index" class="input-row row"><view>{{item.name}}<text wx:if="{{item.robot}}" class="robot">机器人</text></view><input type="text" value="{{inputs[index]}}" maxlength="9" data-index="{{index}}" bindinput="inputScore" disabled="{{busy}}" placeholder="例如 -23"/></view>
 <view class="balance {{balance===0?'positive':'negative'}}">五人合计：{{balance}} 分 {{balance===0?'· 收支平衡':'· 请核对'}}</view>
 <view wx:if="{{preview.length}}" class="preview"><view class="preview-heading row"><text>玩家</text><text>本局加权 → 累计</text></view><view wx:for="{{preview}}" wx:key="index" class="preview-row row"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text class="{{item.negative?'negative':'positive'}}">{{item.value}} → {{item.next}}</text></view></view>
 <view class="label">本局备注</view><input value="{{note}}" maxlength="100" bindinput="inputNote" placeholder="例如：晚场 · 第2桌" disabled="{{busy}}"/>
 <button class="primary save" bindtap="save" disabled="{{!canSave}}">保存第 {{roundNumber}} 局 · 自动累计</button><view class="muted">不读取图片中的游戏局数。请上传单局结算图，连续上传累计战绩图会重复计分。</view></view>
 <block wx:if="{{tab==='history'}}"><view class="card"><view class="row"><view class="title">每一局，都有记录</view><button size="mini" bindtap="undo" disabled="{{!roundCount||busy}}">撤销上一局</button></view><view wx:if="{{!history.length}}" class="empty">还没有记录，去记下第一局吧。</view></view><view wx:for="{{history}}" wx:key="number" class="card"><view class="row"><view class="title">第 {{item.number}} 局</view><view class="muted">{{item.time}} UTC</view></view><view wx:if="{{item.note}}" class="muted">{{item.note}}</view><view wx:for="{{item.values}}" wx:for-item="v" wx:key="index" class="history-row row"><view>{{v.name}}<text wx:if="{{v.robot}}" class="robot">机器人</text></view><view class="right"><view class="{{v.negative?'negative':'positive'}}">{{v.value}}</view><view class="muted">原始 {{v.raw}}</view></view></view></view></block>
 <view wx:if="{{tab==='tools'}}" class="card"><view class="title">把这场牌局，妥善留好</view><view class="muted">记录只保存在当前微信、当前设备。分享小程序不会同步账本。卸载、清理数据或换设备前请先备份。</view><view class="actions"><button bindtap="exportBackup">导出备份</button><button bindtap="openImport" disabled="{{busy}}">恢复备份</button></view><view class="actions"><button bindtap="copySummary">复制本场积分</button><button class="danger" bindtap="newGame" disabled="{{busy}}">新开一场</button></view><view class="label">加权规则</view><view class="muted">排除机器人，取真人赢分总额W和输分绝对值总额L中的较小值P。赢家按个人赢分/W分配P，输家按个人输分/L承担P。真人全部赢或全部输时均记0。尾差用最大余数法补齐，保证合计为0。每局保留保存时的机器人名单，修改设置不重算历史。</view><view class="label">截图识别与隐私</view><view class="muted">只有点击云端识别并确认后，截图才会发送至云函数和腾讯云OCR。项目代码不持久保存截图，不记录图片日志。OCR可能产生服务费用；密钥仅放在云函数环境变量中。识别结果只作建议，务必核对数字、正负号和玩家对应关系。</view><view class="label">仅用于游戏积分记录</view><view class="muted">不包含现金充值、转账或提现功能。</view></view>
 <view class="footer">血战账本 · 把每一局记清楚</view>
</view>
<view wx:if="{{showSettings}}" class="mask"><scroll-view scroll-y class="dialog"><view class="title">这桌有哪些牌友？</view><view class="muted">勾选的玩家按机器人处理。修改名单需先新开一场；机器人设置仅影响下一局。</view><checkbox-group bindchange="robotChange"><view wx:for="{{editNames}}" wx:key="index" class="setting-row row"><input value="{{item}}" maxlength="16" data-index="{{index}}" bindinput="editName" disabled="{{roundCount>0}}"/><label><checkbox value="{{index}}" checked="{{robotFlags[index]}}" color="#19634c"/>机器人</label></view></checkbox-group><view class="actions"><button bindtap="closeSettings">取消</button><button class="primary" bindtap="saveSettings">保存设置</button></view></scroll-view></view>
<view wx:if="{{showBackup}}" class="mask"><view class="dialog"><view class="title">{{backupMode==='export'?'导出备份':'恢复备份'}}</view><view class="muted">{{backupMode==='export'?'复制完整JSON后保存到自己的文件或备忘录。':'粘贴本小程序导出的完整JSON。恢复将覆盖当前记录，建议先备份。'}}</view><textarea value="{{backupText}}" bindinput="backupInput" maxlength="-1" disabled="{{backupMode==='export'}}"/><view class="actions"><button bindtap="closeBackup">关闭</button><button wx:if="{{backupMode==='export'}}" class="primary" bindtap="copyBackup">复制备份</button><button wx:else class="primary" bindtap="importBackup">验证并恢复</button></view></view></view>
